setup.body:
Create /etc/claude-code/managed-settings.json (root, 0644) with the block below. If the file exists, add the two entries to its "hooks" instead of replacing it. Hooks in this file run for every user and cannot be turned off from a user's or a project's settings.

{
  "hooks": {
    "PreToolUse": [{"matcher": "*", "hooks": [{"type": "command", "command": "/usr/local/lib/jt-ai-agent/jt-ai-agent-hook.py", "timeout": 5}]}],
    "SessionStart": [{"hooks": [{"type": "command", "command": "/usr/local/lib/jt-ai-agent/jt-ai-agent-hook.py", "timeout": 5}]}]
  }
}

New sessions pick it up; running sessions may need a restart. For a single user only, the same block can go into that user's ~/.claude/settings.json (the user can remove it).

setup.body_zh:
建立 /etc/claude-code/managed-settings.json（root、0644），內容如下。檔案已經存在時，把這兩項加進它的 "hooks"，不要整份取代。這個檔案裡的 hook 對所有使用者生效，使用者或專案的設定都關不掉。

{
  "hooks": {
    "PreToolUse": [{"matcher": "*", "hooks": [{"type": "command", "command": "/usr/local/lib/jt-ai-agent/jt-ai-agent-hook.py", "timeout": 5}]}],
    "SessionStart": [{"hooks": [{"type": "command", "command": "/usr/local/lib/jt-ai-agent/jt-ai-agent-hook.py", "timeout": 5}]}]
  }
}

新的工作階段就會套用；執行中的工作階段可能要重新開始。只想對一個使用者啟用時，同一段可以放在該使用者的 ~/.claude/settings.json（他自己可以拿掉）。
